    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No.21 Skylark Park View, St Marnocks Bay, a beautifully presented 4 bedroom semi detached home which boasts a sunny west facing aspect and overlooks mature hedges close to large open green space which is ideal for families. This A2 rated energy efficient property boasts a whole host of fantastic features which can only be truly appreciated upon viewing. This property is ideally located next to Skylark Park which is a large 3 acre green space suitable for all ages to enjoy.\r\n\r\nOn arrival you are greeted by a cobblelock front drive by Kilsaran with 2 car spaces. When you enter the property you are instantly impressed by it’s light filled and airy hall with engineered wood flooring throughout, bright lounge, tiled guest wc, open plan style kitchen / dining area & family area with doors leading to a large west facing rear garden which captures the sun all day long. On the first floor there are 4 spacious bedrooms (master en suite) with an abundance of fitted wardrobes and a family bathroom. This home also benefits from a large attic with Stira ladder and offers excellent storage and potential for future conversion.\r\n\r\nThis location offers stunning coastal walks and direct access to the new greenway stretching to Baldoyle. St Marnocks Bay is just a 2-minute walk to Portmarnock DART station for an easy commute to the city centre, one stop from Malahide village and castle, and only 15 minutes to Dublin Airport. Both Primary & Secondary Schools are also within easy reach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall   \t7.22 x 1.95\tSpotlights, decorative timber floor, dragons den under stair storage, security alarm\r\n\r\nWc\t        1.7 x 1.75\tTiled floor & partially tiled walls, wc, whb, large mirror\r\n \r\nLounge\t3.92 x 5.28\tDecorative timber floor, Tv point \r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining & Family area  Fully fitted kitchen units by Kube, Quartz countertop, Neff oven, microwave, extractor fan, induction hob, fridge freezer, door to utility area, family zone with velux roof light and door to rear garden\r\n\r\nUtility Room\t\t  Plumbed for washing machine & dryer, shelved storage  \r\n \r\nStairs / Landing\t\tCarpet floor, pull down ladder attic access, large storage press with shelving \r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1\t3.52 x 2.25\tCarpet floor, fitted wardrobes\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t3.54 x 3.6\tCarpet floor, fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom\t1.95 x 2.3\tTiled floor & walls, wc, whb, mirror, heated rail, bath suite, handheld shower, vanity, spotlights\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 3\t3.78 x 2.26  \tCarpet floor \r\n\t\t\r\nMaster Bedroom   3.55 x 3.85\t  Carpet floor, fitted wardrobes\r\n\t\t\r\nEn suite\t2.38 x 1.75\tTiled floor & walls, heated rail, walk in shower with waterfall head, wc, whb, large mirror\r\n\r\nRear Garden                   Walled & fenced, part patio, part lawn, sunny west facing aspect, large side passage"
      },
